WEBVTT

00:14:57.042 --> 00:15:00.559
he had to help players
and agents get results too,

00:15:00.583 --> 00:15:03.601
and that commitment
became its own kind of rush.

00:15:03.625 --> 00:15:06.143
JB: You're just excited to get deals done

00:15:06.167 --> 00:15:08.934
and sometimes it's hard,
sometimes it takes a while.

00:15:08.958 --> 00:15:13.143
You know, you're handing,
22-, 23-, 24-year-old kids

00:15:13.167 --> 00:15:16.601
25 million dollars,
75 million dollars, 80 million dollars,

00:15:16.625 --> 00:15:21.476
and it can get very emotional and it's fun
to see these players being rewarded.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.184
AG: Well, I mean, it's really cool

00:15:23.208 --> 00:15:26.309
to hear you actually thinking
about how it's gonna help them

00:15:26.333 --> 00:15:29.309
as opposed to just, OK,
what's it going to do for me?

00:15:29.333 --> 00:15:32.059
JB: I think I've just found
the more creative you can get,